=== what each declared coefficient implies for Y ===
    impact_fraction = C * sqrt(p) is being asked to equal
    Y * sigma * sqrt(p), so Y = C / sigma. Y is O(1) in the
    literature this shape comes from.

  C = 0.1      (live default (strategy.yaml))
      implies Y = 4.953  -- far too expensive
  C = 0.0001   (config, read only by dead archive code)
      implies Y = 0.004953  -- far too cheap

  C that makes Y = 1 on this panel: 0.0202
  C that makes Y = 0.5:              0.0101

