Read the participation column first. At $25,000 against a median
name it is a ten-thousandth of a day's volume, and the square-root
law is not the binding cost at that size -- commission and spread
are (R22, R24). The coefficient matters for what it would do at
SIZE, which is a question about a capital base this project does
not have.
